WEBVTT

00:00:19.480 --> 00:00:28.900
I'm a robot, I'm a machine, I'm a machine, but I'm a wind.

00:00:31.530 --> 00:00:31.990
Just

00:00:33.550 --> 00:00:33.830
One

00:00:33.830 --> 00:00:34.170
Two

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:37.550
Three

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:03.290
A young man who's fallen in love with the fighting beast, Shigan.

00:01:06.140 --> 00:01:23.060
They're the kind of people I've always wanted to meet.

00:01:23.720 --> 00:01:24.680
Good morning, sister!

00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:26.670
Good morning!

00:03:14.200 --> 00:03:14.380
Are you all right?

00:03:14.560 --> 00:03:24.260
Leave me alone.

00:03:24.500 --> 00:03:25.880
I won't go.

00:03:26.060 --> 00:03:26.900
You're so injured.

00:03:33.420 --> 00:03:35.520
A young man like you can only make fun of a girl?

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.660
If you're not pitiful, that's fine.

00:03:39.110 --> 00:03:41.560
Why don't you stop lecturing me?

00:03:42.460 --> 00:03:44.080
I don't remember losing to you.

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:50.920
I've seen you somewhere before.

00:03:51.700 --> 00:03:54.600
In the sky of others, right?

00:03:55.560 --> 00:03:57.610
Then why can't I see you properly?

00:04:03.000 --> 00:04:03.640
Don't tell me...

00:04:36.720 --> 00:04:45.570
They're aiming at the nuclear power plant.

00:04:46.110 --> 00:04:48.680
If they explode there, the damage will be half a kilometer.

00:04:49.640 --> 00:04:52.170
There are schools and hospitals in there.

00:04:52.310 --> 00:04:55.000
Roger that. We'll stop them no matter what.

00:05:20.570 --> 00:05:21.480
Tetsuya, are you all right?

00:05:21.640 --> 00:05:23.060
Yes, I'm fine.

00:05:23.220 --> 00:05:28.580
I don't think he was blown away on his way home.

00:05:30.730 --> 00:05:32.670
Ikuta, why are you running away?

00:05:32.890 --> 00:05:33.830
Shut up.

00:05:34.050 --> 00:05:36.950
Did you get caught at a science research facility and get a lecture?

00:05:37.670 --> 00:05:40.440
Ikuta, you've changed a lot in such a short time.

00:05:42.770 --> 00:05:49.600
You've grown up, haven't you?

00:05:49.620 --> 00:05:53.500
Ikuta, is it your youth to run around and make fun of people?

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.400
I told you to stop lecturing me!

00:05:56.180 --> 00:05:58.540
I'm not lecturing you.

00:06:01.436 --> 00:06:05.876
It's sad that you were in the same place when you were in the same place.

00:06:39.280 --> 00:06:43.120
You tried your best to save me, even though you knew you couldn't do it.

00:06:43.120 --> 00:06:45.250
I was so absorbed in it.

00:06:48.590 --> 00:06:51.540
Don't you think you're more pathetic now than you were back then?

00:06:52.060 --> 00:06:55.840
No matter what I do, I'm powerless.

00:06:56.340 --> 00:06:58.300
I can't do anything!

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:05.020
Ikuta, look.

00:07:05.780 --> 00:07:08.520
Tsurugi Tatsuya is also a Koji riding the Great Majinga.

00:07:08.540 --> 00:07:10.130
But he has surpassed Koji's strength.

00:07:10.950 --> 00:07:14.830
So, fighting is youth?

00:07:15.350 --> 00:07:15.570
Yes.

00:07:16.360 --> 00:07:19.590
He dreams of a peaceful life after a battle and burns his youth.

00:07:20.590 --> 00:07:24.390
What do you dream of burning your youth for?

00:07:24.390 --> 00:07:26.130
To drive a cool car?

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.560
Don't you think that's useless?

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:44.000
Hey, I'm sorry, but I'm not going to hurt my heart.

00:07:46.870 --> 00:07:49.230
Then I'll see you later, I'll see you in a little bit.

00:08:26.650 --> 00:08:27.130
Thunderblazer!

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:29.850
Jack, Thunderblazer!

00:08:30.060 --> 00:08:32.400
If you don't, the power plant will blow up, too.

00:08:32.500 --> 00:08:33.090
I understand.

00:08:33.390 --> 00:08:36.550
We'll get rid of it from the power plant and deal with it.

00:08:50.090 --> 00:08:55.870
Jiro, considering the booster's destructive power,

00:08:56.410 --> 00:08:57.760
it won't be easy to use it.

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:00.900
Chief!

00:09:01.120 --> 00:09:02.170
You're late.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:05.020
I'm sorry. Is Tetsuya all right?

00:09:05.420 --> 00:09:07.750
He's in pain because of the power plant.

00:09:07.990 --> 00:09:17.550
The power plant is safe, too.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:26.800
Oh, Teodoros is in danger!

00:09:27.220 --> 00:09:28.580
Let's go to the emergency room.

00:09:29.260 --> 00:09:29.680
Wait!

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:32.200
I just found an interesting guy.

00:09:33.080 --> 00:09:35.440
Keep an eye on the demonica and wait!

00:09:35.900 --> 00:09:36.430
Yes, sir!

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:38.550
Tsurugi, do you think your youth is about repeating endless battles?

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:41.910
I'm different.

00:10:43.080 --> 00:10:46.620
I'm going to break up with the Wanderers and end the war forever.

00:10:46.740 --> 00:10:49.300
I'm going to look back at the people who made fun of me just because I'm an orphan.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:57.380
I'm going to surprise them now!

00:11:00.700 --> 00:11:01.000
Oh!

00:11:07.180 --> 00:11:09.360
Who are you?

00:11:09.820 --> 00:11:13.160
I'm Yanus Koushaku, Emperor of Darkness.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:15.060
Emperor of Darkness?

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.250
Didn't you say you were trapped by Honojun?

00:11:18.970 --> 00:11:20.980
How could you say that?

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.710
Everyone saw me through.

00:11:24.490 --> 00:11:25.630
Then it's too early to talk.

00:11:25.670 --> 00:11:27.380
Take me to Emperor of Darkness.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:29.710
What did you say?

00:11:30.700 --> 00:11:31.540
Can't you see I'm asking you to allow me to join the Dark Emperor?

00:11:33.240 --> 00:11:37.840
You called me Shinichiro Ikuta.

00:11:38.300 --> 00:11:39.380
I'm glad you came.

00:11:39.880 --> 00:11:43.360
Dark Emperor, why don't you stop fighting and live in peace?

00:11:44.780 --> 00:11:47.300
What does the Science Fortress Research Institute say?

00:11:48.300 --> 00:11:50.440
I'll make sure to stop fighting.

00:11:50.720 --> 00:11:52.170
Please appoint me as the dead man.

00:11:53.690 --> 00:11:56.610
If you can do that, then do it.

00:11:57.010 --> 00:11:58.950
General Argos, I'll leave the rest to you.

00:12:00.800 --> 00:12:01.560
The Emperor of Darkness!

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:05.760
Shinichiro Ikuta will now perform a ritual to become an Emperor of Darkness's soldier.

00:12:07.420 --> 00:12:18.230
Ritual? What is this place?

00:12:19.400 --> 00:12:20.240
Now I understand.

00:12:20.440 --> 00:12:24.220
Since you have become our comrade, you must obey our orders.

00:12:24.940 --> 00:12:27.020
Cattle!

00:12:28.620 --> 00:12:29.340
What are you doing?

00:12:31.800 --> 00:12:39.220
I'm going to transform you into a fighting gun!

00:13:05.210 --> 00:13:09.590
Gernikus, I'm Gernikus, and I'm fighting against Shinichiro, who woke up.

00:13:15.230 --> 00:13:22.790
How long are you going to keep thinking about him?

00:13:23.130 --> 00:13:29.480
I...

00:13:30.000 --> 00:13:30.440
Did I say too much?

00:13:30.880 --> 00:13:32.000
No, you didn't.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.870
They're just wasting their youth.

00:13:34.950 --> 00:13:38.710
No matter what they say, we'll do our best for the future.

00:13:38.990 --> 00:13:40.100
That's right.

00:13:42.340 --> 00:13:44.880
I am the one and only Gernicus.

00:13:44.980 --> 00:13:48.360
You have become a friend to us.

00:13:48.360 --> 00:13:51.490
If you can become a warrior of peace and end the war,

00:13:52.770 --> 00:13:54.630
I will restore your body.

00:13:56.170 --> 00:13:57.740
King of Darkness!

00:13:58.360 --> 00:13:58.680
What?

00:14:00.350 --> 00:14:03.730
That must be true. The Emperor of Darkness will also stop the attack, won't he?

00:14:03.860 --> 00:14:08.680
That's right. The battle will be over as long as you continue to work.

00:14:08.680 --> 00:14:09.840
Go ahead and give it a try.

00:14:11.540 --> 00:14:13.300
Let's depart with Emperor Janus and Gernika!

00:14:14.500 --> 00:14:14.900
Yes!

00:14:15.040 --> 00:14:15.950
Gernika, come!

00:14:16.230 --> 00:14:19.610
I've become a battle beast, but...

00:14:19.610 --> 00:14:21.420
Jun, I'll show you what you can't do.

00:14:22.480 --> 00:14:24.370
He's going to betray us anyway.

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:27.880
As soon as he uses it and comes in contact with Venus and Mazinger,

00:14:28.480 --> 00:14:29.220
the time bomb will be activated.

00:14:30.880 --> 00:14:34.270
This is an interesting sight to see.

00:14:43.890 --> 00:14:46.360
What's wrong?

00:14:47.100 --> 00:14:49.560
I have a stomachache.

00:14:49.760 --> 00:14:51.020
You have a stomachache?

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:53.540
The fighter landed yesterday, didn't he?

00:14:53.540 --> 00:14:55.940
At that time, he said he would be able to fly without a stomachache.

00:14:56.380 --> 00:14:58.860
That's right. He even put 10 cups of rice in the bowl.

00:15:00.730 --> 00:15:01.650
You're a boss, aren't you?

00:15:01.810 --> 00:15:03.380
Yes. I'm sorry.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:06.280
I'm sorry to all of you who are looking forward to seeing me perform.

00:15:09.080 --> 00:15:11.200
I'm sorry I can't see you all the time.

00:15:12.580 --> 00:15:16.020
Tetsuya, please be a little more considerate.

00:15:16.660 --> 00:15:18.920
Jun, don't tell me you're going to make me happy!

00:15:30.380 --> 00:15:31.440
I'll tell you the plan!

00:15:31.560 --> 00:15:36.690
While we're negotiating with the Science Fortress Research Institute,

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:41.050
Demonica will be in a position to completely destroy the power plant.

00:15:41.810 --> 00:15:42.810
Yes, Captain!

00:15:43.280 --> 00:15:44.660
Get Gernikas out of here!

00:15:45.120 --> 00:15:47.350
Once he invites the Great Majinger and the Venus Ace,

00:15:48.110 --> 00:15:49.970
we'll head to the power plant at full speed!

00:15:50.390 --> 00:15:55.580
Jun, Tetsuya, go back immediately.

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:57.340
The battleship has landed.

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:00.600
Jun, let's go!

00:16:00.900 --> 00:16:06.810
The Zubarot are here!

00:16:08.390 --> 00:16:19.290
Tsurugi, Tetsuya, Honou, Jun!

00:16:19.490 --> 00:16:20.490
Come out! We need to talk!

00:16:20.770 --> 00:16:22.740
Tsurugi, Tetsuya, Honou, Jun!

00:16:23.180 --> 00:16:24.360
You're finally here, Sentoju!

00:16:33.810 --> 00:16:35.510
Wait! Tsurugi Tetsuya, wait for me!

00:16:35.730 --> 00:16:37.530
What? Wait for me?

00:16:37.930 --> 00:16:40.120
I'm not here to fight. I'm here to negotiate peace.

00:16:40.940 --> 00:16:42.860
What did you say?

00:16:43.020 --> 00:16:45.470
Tsurugi, promise me you won't fight.

00:16:45.570 --> 00:16:47.450
That will be the beginning of everything.

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:48.740
Don't be silly.

00:16:49.120 --> 00:16:50.730
I can't stand fighting to negotiate peace.

00:16:51.930 --> 00:16:54.680
Come on! Majinger Blade!

00:17:02.300 --> 00:17:06.870
Ah, Jun! Listen to me!

00:17:07.930 --> 00:17:09.000
What's that voice?

00:17:09.260 --> 00:17:11.360
It's me, Shinichiro Ikuta!

00:17:11.460 --> 00:17:12.380
What did you say?

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:19.980
Shinichiro?

00:17:20.270 --> 00:17:21.950
Why do you have a fighting gun?

00:17:22.330 --> 00:17:23.960
I have a job that I risked my life for.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.360
Please, both of you listen to me!

00:17:37.360 --> 00:17:38.570
Captain, we've detected an abnormal signal.

00:17:39.150 --> 00:17:41.980
What? In this direction?

00:17:42.360 --> 00:17:44.030
No, it's heading for the power plant.

00:17:44.790 --> 00:17:47.090
Tetsuya, hurry up to the power plant.

00:17:47.430 --> 00:17:48.620
The fighters are heading there.

00:17:48.900 --> 00:17:51.010
Please, back off.

00:17:51.210 --> 00:17:54.670
If you show your will, we'll find out the cause of the darkness.

00:17:54.890 --> 00:17:56.760
Jun, don't be fooled.

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.620
He's saving time.

00:17:59.080 --> 00:17:59.560
What?

00:18:00.190 --> 00:18:01.710
The fortress is heading for the power plant.

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.310
What's going on?

00:18:03.490 --> 00:18:04.140
What did you say?

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:09.160
Wait, Jun.

00:18:09.280 --> 00:18:10.320
This must be a misunderstanding.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:11.020
If we don't protect the power plant,

00:18:11.460 --> 00:18:12.480
something terrible will happen.

00:18:13.310 --> 00:18:13.710
Jun!

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:14.170
Wait!

00:18:14.450 --> 00:18:27.420
He's here.

00:18:27.740 --> 00:18:29.380
I knew this would happen.

00:18:30.700 --> 00:18:41.460
Shinichiro, you were only used by the King of Darkness.

00:18:42.020 --> 00:18:43.160
I was used?

00:18:43.520 --> 00:18:44.220
That's right.

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:47.600
Peace is not something that can come easily

00:18:47.600 --> 00:18:48.480
as long as there is a war.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:54.510
You, who don't know the true value of peace,

00:18:55.220 --> 00:18:56.020
were only used.

00:18:57.450 --> 00:18:59.050
Father...

00:19:00.750 --> 00:19:04.770
The game is over, and you've defeated the Buenas Ace, Guernica.

00:19:05.050 --> 00:19:05.810
Lord Yannes!

00:19:07.350 --> 00:19:08.370
You can't rebel as long as you're with us.

00:19:11.180 --> 00:19:13.200
There's a remote-controlled bomb in your body.

00:19:14.520 --> 00:19:18.490
The switch is on. If you die, you have to defeat the Buenas Ace!

00:19:19.490 --> 00:19:20.520
Shinichiro!

00:19:20.740 --> 00:19:21.700
Don't get close, John!

00:19:21.920 --> 00:19:24.160
Fight! Defeat the Buenas Ace!

00:19:24.960 --> 00:19:26.620
Shinichiro!

00:19:26.860 --> 00:19:29.340
Don't get close!

00:19:31.280 --> 00:19:35.430
Shinichiro, let's go to the research lab and get the bomb out of there!

00:19:36.450 --> 00:19:37.770
Do we have that much time?

00:19:38.310 --> 00:19:39.410
We'll explode in three minutes!

00:19:40.410 --> 00:19:41.130
Three minutes?

00:19:41.370 --> 00:19:43.080
Stop, Jun!

00:19:43.220 --> 00:19:45.080
I was a beastly fighter.

00:19:45.940 --> 00:19:47.550
I'm begging you!

00:19:47.770 --> 00:19:51.870
If you have mercy, I want you to take me to that power plant.

00:19:52.590 --> 00:19:54.940
Jun, head to the Great Maginot's support.

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.080
If the power plant explodes, we'll be in big trouble.

00:19:58.850 --> 00:19:59.830
Jun, we don't have time!

00:20:00.380 --> 00:20:01.960
I don't want to make a mess with the bombs that Yanus has set up.

00:20:03.620 --> 00:20:16.620
I'll do as you say.

00:20:17.400 --> 00:20:18.960
I'll do this, so grab this spear.

00:20:32.040 --> 00:20:42.550
Let go of the spear! Hurry up! What are you waiting for?

00:20:42.590 --> 00:20:43.980
Shinichiro!

00:20:44.200 --> 00:20:46.810
We don't have much time! Hurry up!

00:20:47.110 --> 00:20:47.900
God...

00:20:47.900 --> 00:20:57.450
I'm sorry, Master. We don't have much time.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:14.000
Tetsuya, let's go to the command tower.

00:21:14.760 --> 00:21:16.180
Are you crazy?

00:21:16.620 --> 00:21:20.200
Captain, it's the Lunar Force!

00:21:20.560 --> 00:21:22.760
All right, prepare to launch the booster.

00:21:23.100 --> 00:21:25.210
Tetsuya, I'll launch the booster.

00:21:25.690 --> 00:21:26.910
Get the fortress out of the way.

00:21:26.970 --> 00:21:27.560
Roger that.

00:21:28.130 --> 00:21:28.770
Ready to launch the booster.

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:30.180
Let's go!

00:21:30.820 --> 00:21:47.360
Shinichirou is fighting. What is he planning to do?

00:21:47.400 --> 00:21:48.630
All right, shoot!

00:21:53.550 --> 00:21:57.240
The timing doesn't match. Let's use our hands.

00:22:01.790 --> 00:22:03.440
What the hell are you doing?

00:22:03.720 --> 00:22:04.540
Shinjiro!

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.200
Are you going to defeat Gell?

00:22:17.600 --> 00:22:18.570
Take this!

00:22:18.840 --> 00:22:19.300
No!

00:22:20.540 --> 00:22:29.550
It's a kick!

00:22:30.060 --> 00:22:31.080
The power plant is the next machine!

00:22:31.480 --> 00:22:44.860
Mr. Hiromu...

00:22:44.860 --> 00:22:59.090
Thanks to him, the power plant was saved.

00:23:01.600 --> 00:23:04.770
Shinichiro, you're in too much of a hurry.

00:23:45.480 --> 00:23:51.640
Got the R.D. Sham

00:24:01.052 --> 00:24:01.392
No, no.

00:24:03.036 --> 00:24:05.036
I

00:24:32.748 --> 00:24:38.188
The president was knocked down by the attack of the hellish water, and the research institute was about to be swallowed up by the demonica.

00:24:38.412 --> 00:24:39.532
Yunus is defeated.

00:24:39.536 --> 00:24:42.676
I can't do anything about fighting against two combatants.

00:24:43.116 --> 00:24:46.256
All that's left is for the Mazinger Z to take off.

00:24:46.636 --> 00:24:49.876
Kouji is in a hurry, unaware of his father, Dr. Kabuto.

00:24:50.220 --> 00:24:50.920
Could it be...

00:24:50.956 --> 00:24:52.716
to stop DEMONICA?

00:24:53.004 --> 00:24:56.244
Next time, the great hero, Tetsuya Fite! Dash Kojite!

00:24:56.332 --> 00:24:57.332
Let's meet up!
